Package: jaiabot-offline-base-map
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: Natural Earth base map for the JaiaBot Command & Control
 The Natural Earth land, coastline, lake, river, urban area and port layers, and
 the Mapnik stylesheet the JCC renders its offline base map from. Hubs install it
 to /var/log/jaiabot/lib/maps/natural_earth.
